{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107650","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107650","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710765001:1":{"text":"あれは、ミラーシェイド……第一次神魔大戦の……！？","source_cn":"那是……魔灵镜影……是第一次神魔大战时的……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EF0E282E56DD01F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710765002:1":{"text":"い、いやだ！死にたくないぃっ！","source_cn":"不、我不想死——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4FF4854316FD684","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710765003:1":{"text":"たたたた、助けてくれええええ！！！","source_cn":"救、救、救命啊啊啊啊啊——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D379BA68ADE725","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710765004:1":{"text":"皆さん、後ろに下がって！","source_cn":"都退后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D5D126995B0FF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710765005:0":{"text":"ローランド大帝に敗れた魔物め、この古聖堂で好き勝手はさせない！","source_cn":"罗兰大帝战胜过的魔物，也敢在圣古堂放肆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x940921817C81F73B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710765006:0":{"text":"皆さん、柱の後ろに隠れて